                "description": "By itself, this exquisite crystal knob is indeed beautiful; but when paired with Emtek's Regular Rose, the knob is even more gorgeous. The Old Town Knob with Regular Round Rose is available in a wide array of traditional finishes. This crystal clear knob is a great way to add old world allure to any home. The Old Town Clear Crystal Knob with Regular Rosette is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n",
